<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><i>Transactions for the nine month period
ended September 30, 2022, are as follows:</i></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify"><i>&#160;</i></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%"> <tr style="vertical-align: top"> <td style="width: 0.75in">&#160;</td> <td style="width: 0.25in"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="_DescriptionOfSignificantEventsAndTransactions-c0_cont_1" name="ifrs-full:DescriptionOfSignificantEventsAndTransactions"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></ix:nonNumeric></td> <td style="text-align: justify"><ix:continuation continuedAt="_DescriptionOfSignificantEventsAndTransactions-c0_cont_2" id="_DescriptionOfSignificantEventsAndTransactions-c0_cont_1"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">On March 9, 2022, the Company granted 4,500 RSU&#8217;s to Directors that vest immediately. On the date of granting, the fair value and stock price was $103.00/share.</span></ix:continuation></td></tr> </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:continuation continuedAt="_DescriptionOfSignificantEventsAndTransactions-c0_cont_3" id="_DescriptionOfSignificantEventsAndTransactions-c0_cont_2"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
