    <td style="text-align: justify; width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</span></td>
    <td style="text-align: justify">
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On March 9, 2022, the Company granted 18,000
RSU&#8217;s to a Director that vest quarterly over 12 periods with the first vesting of 1,500 RSU&#8217;s occurring on the date of the
granted and another 1,500 vest every three months until all of the granted RSU&#8217;s have vested. On the date of granting, the fair
value and the stock price was $103.00/share.&#160;</p>
    <p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; margin: 0pt 0"></p></td></tr>
