    <td style="width: 24px"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>15.</b></span></td>
    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>SEGMENTED INFORMATION</b></span></td></tr>
  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">The Company is domiciled in Canada,
and it operates and produces its income primarily in Israel, Europe and North America. The Company operates as a single segment being
the sale of cellular-based communications products.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s entity-wide disclosures
include disaggregated information about product sales, geographical areas, and major customers.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

